00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:16.940
confirmed together, the sector often leads for several sessions afterward.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:22.860
Always pair the rotation signal with the same-day volume check above the 20-day average before

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.120
