00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:52.400
The bid asked spread on that name widened from two cents to fifteen cents in the first

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.980
thirty minutes, because volume stayed below the twenty-day average.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:01.760
What most retail investors do not realize is that a breakout without that volume filter often

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:06.580
reverses within two sessions as the lack of follow-through lets sellers step back in.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:12.400
The pro tip is to open the volume column in your platform before you click by and compare

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.260
today's bar to the 20-day line.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:20.180
The concrete misconception to avoid is treating any price jump as confirmation when the

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:24.300
real edge comes from requiring volume to exceed the average on the same day.

